        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are regulated under insurance laws in the United States and other countries where we offer insurance services.",
        "start_character": 62773,
        "end_character": 62900
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Data breach and operational outage notification laws or regulatory activities to encourage such notifications and regulatory activity and laws around resiliency, business continuity and third-party risk management are also becoming more prevalent in jurisdictions outside the United States in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 75772,
        "end_character": 76082
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, legislators and regulators in various countries in which we operate have focused on the offering of consumer financial products and the operation of payment networks, resulting in changes to certain practices or pricing of card issuers, merchant acquirers and payment networks, and, in some cases, the establishment of broad and ongoing regulatory oversight regimes.",
        "start_character": 33086,
        "end_character": 33465
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Third, we are focused on strengthening our global, integrated network by continuing to increase merchant acceptance, providing merchants with fraud protection services, marketing insights and connections to higher-spending Card Members and working with our network partners to offer expanded products and services.",
        "start_character": 15935,
        "end_character": 16249
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We acquire and retain high-spending, engaged and creditworthy Card Members by designing innovative credit, charge and debit card products and payment and lending solutions that appeal to our target customer base and meet their spending and borrowing needs.",
        "start_character": 4738,
        "end_character": 4994
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We aim to provide the world’s best customer experience every day and our reputation for world-class service has been recognized by numerous awards over the years.",
        "start_character": 14621,
        "end_character": 14783
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also continue to explore ways to deploy new and developing technologies to enhance our payments platform and customer experience, such as uses for generative artificial intelligence (AI) and the integration of our products and services in agentic commerce.",
        "start_character": 3634,
        "end_character": 3893
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also leverage our technology to provide differentiated value to customers, such as special offers and benefits to Card Members and targeted marketing and other information services for merchants and partners, as well as to develop and improve our customer interfaces and service capabilities to continue to deliver a high-quality customer experience.",
        "start_character": 3280,
        "end_character": 3633
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide non-card business-to-business (B2B) payment products and cash and expense management solutions to our commercial clients, which we are enhancing through our 2025 acquisition of Center, an expense management software company.",
        "start_character": 6801,
        "end_character": 7041
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also utilize technology to provide customers with a range of servicing channels and tools designed to meet their preferences and enhance their service experience.",
        "start_character": 14989,
        "end_character": 15154
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a broad set of card products, rewards and services to this premium consumer and broad commercial customer base, in the United States and internationally, through our USCS, CS and ICS reportable operating segments.",
        "start_character": 4063,
        "end_character": 4285
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000004962-26-000080",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000004962-26-000080-1fbcd69c3e7b3693",
        "accession_number": "0000004962-26-000080",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At the heart of our workplace culture are our Blue Box Values, which are a set of guiding principles that serve as the foundation for how we operate as a company and lead.",
        "start_character": 17558,
        "end_character": 17729
      }
    ]
